  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "在骄阳似火的日子，让家中凉爽宜人。试试厚实的蓝色窗帘，如宜家 MERETE 麦瑞特 蓝色窗帘。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "s59259931",
    "10396581",
    "90321105"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/10/ba/10ba2f1cd9cdb869ed1f51fe4c98d1dc.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
